    66: "אַבֵל מַיִם (ʼAbêl Mayim | aw-bale' mah'-yim)\n\nDerivation: from H58 אָבֵל and H4325 מַיִם ; meadow of water\nStrong's: Abel-Majim, a place in Palestine\nKJV: Abel-maim.\n\nCognate Group: H59 (Abel), H65 (Abel-meholah), H62 (Abel-beth-maachah), H67 (Abel-mizraim), H64 (plain of the vineyards), H58 (plain), H66 (Abel-maim), H63 (Abelshittim)",
