    262: "אַחְוָה (ʼachvâh | akh-vaw')\n\nDerivation: from H2331 חָוָה (in the sense of H2324 חֲוָא)\nStrong's: an utterance\nKJV: declaration.\n\nCognate Group: H2331 (show), H262 (declaration)\nGreek Equivalents: G312 ἀναγγέλλω",
