    484: "אַלְמֻגִּים (ʼalmuggîym | al-moog-gheem')\n\nDerivation: probably of foreign derivation (used thus only in the plural)\nStrong's: almug (i.e. probably sandle-wood) sticks\nKJV: almug trees. Compare H418 אַלְגּוּמִּים .\n\nCognate Group: H486 (Almodad), H417 (great hail), H510 (no rising up), H484 (almug trees), H418 (algum), H513 (Eltolad)",
