    486: "אַלְמֹודָד (ʼAlmôwdâd | al-mo-dawd')\n\nDerivation: probably of foreign derivation\nStrong's: Almodad, a son of Joktan\nKJV: Almodad.\n\nCognate Group: H486 (Almodad), H417 (great hail), H510 (no rising up), H484 (almug trees), H418 (algum), H513 (Eltolad)\nGreek Equivalents: G1678 Ἐλμωδάμ",
