    652: "אֹפֶל (ʼôphel | o'fel)\n\nDerivation: from the same as H651 אָפֵל\nStrong's: dusk\nKJV: darkness, obscurity, privily.\n\nCognate Group: H3991 (darkness), H648 (not grown up), H3990 (darkness), H652 (darkness), H653 (dark), H651 (very dark)\nGreek Equivalents: G3491 ναῦς, G4653 σκοτία, G4655 σκότος",
