    803: "אֲשׁוּיָה (ʼăshûwyâh | ash-oo-yah')\n\nDerivation: feminine passive participle from an unused root meaning to found\nStrong's: foundation\nKJV: foundation.\n\nCognate Group: H2977 (Josiah), H810 (stone), H805 (Asshurim), H807 (Ashima), H804 (Asshur), H803 (foundation), H812 (Eshcol), H811 (cluster), H813 (Ashkenaz)",
