    1315: "בׇּשְׂמַת (Bosmath | bos-math')\n\nDerivation: feminine of H1314 בֶּשֶׂם (the second form); fragrance\nStrong's: Bosmath, the name of a wife of Esau, and of a daughter of Solomon\nKJV: Bashemath, Basmath.\n\nCognate Group: H1314 (smell), H4017 (Mibsam), H3005 (Jibsam), H1313 (spice), H1315 (Bashemath)",
