    1466: "גֵּוָה (gêvâh | gay-vaw')\n\nDerivation: the same as H1465 גֵּוָה\nStrong's: exaltation; (figuratively) arrogance\nKJV: lifting up, pride.\n\nCognate Group: H1346 (excellency), H1341 (proud), H1348 (excellent things), H1344 (pride), H1466 (lifting up), H1345 (Geuel), H1342 (gloriously), H1349 (proud), H1343 (proud), H1347 (arrogancy)\nGreek Equivalents: G5196 ὕβρις",
