    1527: "גִּינַת (Gîynath | ghee-nath')\n\nDerivation: of uncertain derivation\nStrong's: Ginath, an Israelite\nKJV: Ginath.\n\nCognate Group: H1599 (Ginnetho), H1598 (defend), H1594 (garden), H4042 (deliver), H4043 ([idiom] armed), H1588 (garden), H1527 (Ginath), H1593 (garden), H4044 (sorrow)",
