    1546: "גָּלוּת (gâlûwth | gaw-looth')\n\nDerivation: feminine from H1540 גָּלָה\nStrong's: captivity; concretely, exiles (collectively)\nKJV: (they that are carried away) captives(-ity).\n\nCognate Group: H1555 (Goliath), H1546 (captives), H3020 (Jogli), H1540 (advertise), H1473 (captive), H1549 (glass)",
    1547: "גָּלוּת (gâlûwth | gaw-looth')\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) corresponding to H1546 גָּלוּת \nStrong's: captivity; concretely, exiles (collectively)\nKJV: captivity.\n\nCognate Group: H1547 (captivity), H1541 (bring over)",
