    1989: "הַלְמוּת (halmûwth | hal-mooth')\n\nDerivation: from H1986 הָלַם\nStrong's: a hammer (or mallet)\nKJV: hammer.\n\nCognate Group: H3095 (diamond), H1987 (Helem), H4112 (stripe), H1986 (beat), H1989 (hammer)",
    1990: "הָם (Hâm | hawm)\n\nDerivation: of uncertain derivation\nStrong's: Ham, a region of Palestine\nKJV: Ham.\n\nCognate Group: H1991 (any of theirs), H1988 (here), H4099 (Hammedatha), H1990 (Ham)",
