    2006: "הֵן (hên | hane)\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) corresponding to H2005 הֵן\nStrong's: lo! also there(-fore), (un-) less, whether, but, if\nKJV: (that) if, or, whether.\n\nCognate Group: H2006 (if)",
