    2081: "זְבִינָא (Zᵉbîynâʼ | zeb-ee-naw')\n\nDerivation: from an unused root (meaning to purchase); gainfulness\nStrong's: Zebina, an Israelite\nKJV: Zebina.\n\nCognate Group: H2081 (Zebina), H2078 (Zebah), H4196 (altar), H2077 (offer), H2076 (kill)",
