    2554: "חָמַס (châmaç | khaw-mas')\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to be violent; by implication, to maltreat\nKJV: make bare, shake off, violate, do violence, take away violently, wrong, imagine wrongfully.\n\nCognate Group: H8464 (night hawk), H2555 (cruel), H2554 (make bare)\nGreek Equivalents: G91 ἀδικέω, G114 ἀθετέω, G764 ἀσεβέω, G1572 ἐκκαίω, G1945 ἐπίκειμαι, G3856 παραδειγματίζω, G5166 τρυγάω",
