    2706: "חֹק (chôq | khoke)\n\nDerivation: from H2710 חָקַק\nStrong's: an enactment; hence, an appointment (of time, space, quantity, labor or usage)\nKJV: appointed, bound, commandment, convenient, custom, decree(-d), due, law, measure, [idiom] necessary, ordinance(-nary), portion, set time, statute, task.\n\nCognate Group: H2708 (appointed), H2711 (decree), H2710 (appoint), H2712 (Hukkok), H2706 (appointed)\nGreek Equivalents: G705 ἀριθμέω, G842 αὐτάρκης, G1345 δικαίωμα, G1394 δόσις, G1785 ἐντολή, G2041 ἔργον, G2917 κρίμα, G3551 νόμος, G3725 ὅριον",
