    2718: "חֲרַב (chărab | khar-ab')\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) a root corresponding to H2717 חָרַב\nStrong's: to demolish\nKJV: destroy.\n\nCognate Group: H2749 (magician), H2718 (destroy)",
