    3203: "יְכׇלְיָה (Yᵉkolyâh | yek-ol-yaw')\n\nDerivation: and יְכׇלְיָהוּ; or (2 Chronicles 26:3) יְכִילְיָה; from H3201 יָכֹל and H3050 יָהּ ; Jah will enable\nStrong's: Jekoljah or Jekiljah, an Israelitess\nKJV: Jecholiah, Jecoliah.\n\nCognate Group: H3203 (Jecholiah), H3201 (be able)",
    3204: "יְכׇנְיָה (Yᵉkonyâh | yek-on-yaw')\n\nDerivation: and יְכׇנְיָהוּ; or (Jeremiah 27:20) יְכֹונְיָה; from H3559 כּוּן and H3050 יָהּ ; Jah will establish\nStrong's: Jekonjah, a Jewish king\nKJV: Jeconiah. Compare H3659 כׇּנְיָהוּ .\n\nCognate Group: H3561 (cake), H8499 (seat), H3200 (Jachinites), H3559 (certain), H3651 (after that), H3560 (Chun), H8498 (fashion), H3562 (Conaniah), H4369 (base), H4349 (foundation), H4350 (base), H3199 (Jachin), H3204 (Jeconiah), H5225 (Nachon), H3563 (cup)\nGreek Equivalents: G2423 Ἰεχονίας",
    3205: "יָלַד (yâlad | yaw-lad')\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to bear young; causatively, to beget; medically, to act as midwife; specifically, to show lineage\nKJV: bear, beget, birth(-day), born, (make to) bring forth (children, young), bring up, calve, child, come, be delivered (of a child), time of delivery, gender, hatch, labour, (do the office of a) midwife, declare pedigrees, be the son of, (woman in, woman that) travail(-eth, -ing woman).\n\nCognate Group: H3206 (boy), H3205 (bear), H2056 (child), H8434 (Tolad), H4138 (begotten), H4137 (Moladah), H3209 (born), H3208 (childhood), H3207 (damsel), H4140 (Molid), H3211 (born), H8435 (birth), H3210 (Jalon)\nGreek Equivalents: G1078 γένεσις, G1081 γέννημα, G1083 γέννησις, G1084 γεννητός, G1096 γίνομαι, G1135 γυνή, G1980 ἐπισκέπτομαι, G2932 κτάομαι, G3384 μήτηρ, G5043 τέκνον, G5088 τίκτω, G5604 ὠδίν",
    3206: "יֶלֶד (yeled | yeh'-led)\n\nDerivation: from H3205 יָלַד\nStrong's: something born, i.e. a lad or offspring\nKJV: boy, child, fruit, son, young man (one).\n\nCognate Group: H3206 (boy), H3205 (bear), H2056 (child), H8434 (Tolad), H4138 (begotten), H4137 (Moladah), H3209 (born), H3208 (childhood), H3207 (damsel), H4140 (Molid), H3211 (born), H8435 (birth), H3210 (Jalon)\nGreek Equivalents: G730 ἄῤῥην, G3494 νεανίας, G3495 νεανίσκος, G3501 νέος, G3502 νεοσσός, G3808 παιδάριον, G3813 παιδίον, G3816 παῖς, G5043 τέκνον, G5207 υἱός",
    3207: "יַלְדָּה (yaldâh | yal-daw')\n\nDerivation: feminine of H3206 יֶלֶד\nStrong's: a lass\nKJV: damsel, girl.\n\nCognate Group: H3206 (boy), H3205 (bear), H2056 (child), H8434 (Tolad), H4138 (begotten), H4137 (Moladah), H3209 (born), H3208 (childhood), H3207 (damsel), H4140 (Molid), H3211 (born), H8435 (birth), H3210 (Jalon)\nGreek Equivalents: G2877 κοράσιον, G3814 παιδίσκη",
