    3236: "יִמְרָה (Yimrâh | yim-raw')\n\nDerivation: probably from H3235 יָמַר ; interchange\nStrong's: Jimrah, an Israelite\nKJV: Imrah.\n\nCognate Group: H4796 (Maroth), H4805 (bitter), H4792 (Merom), H4784 (bitter), H4790 (broken), H3236 (Imrah)",
