    3242: "יְנִיקָה (yᵉnîyqâh | yen-ee-kaw')\n\nDerivation: from H3243 יָנַק\nStrong's: a sucker or sapling\nKJV: young twig.\n\nCognate Group: H3126 (tender plant), H3243 (milch), H3127 (branch), H3242 (young twig)",
