    3628: "כְּלִיא (kᵉlîyʼ | kel-ee')\n\nDerivation: or כְּלוּא; from H3627 כְּלִי (compare H3608 כֶּלֶא)\nStrong's: a prison\nKJV: prison.\n\nCognate Group: H4356 (fold), H3608 (prison), H3609 (Chileab), H3610 (divers seeds), H3607 (finish), H3628 (prison)",
