    3847: "לָבַשׁ (lâbash | law-bash')\n\nDerivation: or לָבֵשׁ; a primitive root\nStrong's: properly, wrap around, i.e. (by implication) to put on agarment or clothe (oneself, or another), literally or figuratively\nKJV: (in) apparel, arm, array (self), clothe (self), come upon, put (on, upon), wear.\n\nCognate Group: H3850 (Lod), H8516 (clothing), H3847 (apparel), H3849 (log), H3830 (apparel), H4403 (apparel), H1688 (Debir)\nGreek Equivalents: G294 ἀμφιέννυμι, G1737 ἐνδιδύσκω, G1743 ἐνδυναμόω, G1744 ἐνδύνω, G1746 ἐνδύω, G1839 ἐξίστημι, G4016 περιβάλλω, G4060 περιτίθημι",
