    4529: "מָסָה (mâçâh | maw-saw')\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to dissolve\nKJV: make to consume away, (make to) melt, water.\n\nCognate Group: H4529 (make to consume away), H4535 (broken down)\nGreek Equivalents: G1026 βρέχω, G3179 μεθίστημι, G5080 τήκω",
