    4533: "מַסְוֶה (maçveh | mas-veh')\n\nDerivation: apparently from an unused root meaning to cover\nStrong's: a veil\nKJV: vail.\n\nCognate Group: H5497 (clothes), H4533 (vail)\nGreek Equivalents: G2571 κάλυμα",
