    4536: "מִסְחָר (miçchâr | mis-khawr')\n\nDerivation: from H5503 סָחַר\nStrong's: trade\nKJV: traffic.\n\nCognate Group: H5513 (Sinite), H5506 (merchandise), H5511 (Sihon), H5515 (Sinim), H5510 (Sivan), H5514 (Sinai), H5525 (Sukkiims), H5518 (caldron), H5504 (merchandise), H5522 (tabernacle), H5516 (Sisera), H5524 (Succothbenoth), H5512 (Sin), H5507 (buckler), H5503 (go about), H4536 (traffic), H5508 (black marble), H5505 (mart), H5517 (Sia)",
    4537: "מָסַךְ (mâçak | maw-sak')\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to mix, especially wine (with spices)\nKJV: mingle.\n\nCognate Group: H4544 (scarceness), H4537 (mingle), H4542 (poor), H4469 (drink-offering), H4538 (mixture)\nGreek Equivalents: G2767 κεράννυμι",
    4538: "מֶסֶךְ (meçek | meh'-sek)\n\nDerivation: from H4537 מָסַךְ\nStrong's: a mixture, i.e. of wine with spices\nKJV: mixture.\n\nCognate Group: H4544 (scarceness), H4537 (mingle), H4542 (poor), H4469 (drink-offering), H4538 (mixture)",
    4539: "מָסָךְ (mâçâk | maw-sawk')\n\nDerivation: from H5526 סָכַךְ\nStrong's: a cover, i.e. veil\nKJV: covering, curtain, hanging.\n\nCognate Group: H4329 (covert), H5526 (cover), H4540 (covering), H4539 (covering)\nGreek Equivalents: G1942 ἐπικάλυμα, G2571 κάλυμα, G2665 καταπέτασμα",
