    4543: "מִסְכְּנָה (miçkᵉnâh | mis-ken-aw')\n\nDerivation: by transp. from H3664 כָּנַס\nStrong's: a magazine\nKJV: store(-house), treasure.\n\nCognate Group: H5532 (acquaint), H4543 (store)\nGreek Equivalents: G4066 περίχωρος, G4638 σκήνωμα",
