    4572: "מַעֲדַי (Maʻăday | mah-ad-ah'-ee)\n\nDerivation: from H5710 עָדָה ; ornamental\nStrong's: Maadai, an Israelite\nKJV: Maadai.\n\nCognate Group: H5976 (be at a stand), H4153 (Moadiah), H4571 (make to shake), H4572 (Maadai), H4154 (out of joint), H4573 (Maadiah)",
    4573: "מַעֲדְיָה (Maʻădyâh | mah-ad-yaw')\n\nDerivation: from H5710 עָדָה and H3050 יָהּ ; ornament of Jah\nStrong's: Maadjah, an Israelite\nKJV: Maadiah. Compare H4153 מֹועַדְיָה .\n\nCognate Group: H5976 (be at a stand), H4153 (Moadiah), H4571 (make to shake), H4572 (Maadai), H4154 (out of joint), H4573 (Maadiah)",
    4574: "מַעֲדָן (maʻădân | mah-ad-awn')\n\nDerivation: or (feminine) מַעֲדַנָּה; from H5727 עָדַן\nStrong's: a delicacy or (abstractly) pleasure (adverbially, cheerfully)\nKJV: dainty, delicately, delight.\n\nCognate Group: H5731 (Eden), H5734 (Adnah), H5730 (delicate), H4574 (dainty), H5722 (Adino), H5721 (Adina), H5733 (Adna), H5719 (given to pleasures), H6112 (Eznite), H5727 (delight self), H5720 (Adin)",
    4575: "מַעֲדַנָּה (maʻădannâh | mah-ad-an-naw')\n\nDerivation: by transitive from H6029 עָנַד\nStrong's: a bond, i.e. group\nKJV: influence.\n\nCognate Group: H4575 (influence), H6029 (bind)",
