    4586: "מְעוּנִי (Mᵉʻûwnîy | meh-oo-nee')\n\nTypo: lemma מְעוּנָי third vowel, corrected to מְעוּנִי\n\nDerivation: or מְעִינִי; probably patrial from H4584 מָעֹון\nStrong's: a Meunite, or inhabitant of Maon (only in plural)\nKJV: Mehunim(-s), Meunim.\n\nCognate Group: H4586 (Mehunim), H4579 (gravel), H4578 (belly)",
