    4756: "מָרֵא (mârêʼ | maw-ray')\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) from a root corresponding to H4754 מָרָא in the sense of domineering\nStrong's: a master\nKJV: lord, Lord.\n\nCognate Group: H4483 (number), H4577 (belly), H4484 (Mene), H4756 (lord), H4779 (rebellious), H4776 (rebellion), H4510 (number), H4504 (oblation)\nGreek Equivalents: G935 βασιλεύς, G2962 κύριος",
