    4764: "מֵרָב (Mêrâb | may-rawb')\n\nDerivation: from H7231 רָבַב ; increase\nStrong's: Merab, a daughter of Saul\nKJV: Merab.\n\nCognate Group: H4806 (fat beast), H4760 (crop), H4764 (Merab)",
    4765: "מַרְבַד (marbad | mar-bad')\n\nDerivation: from H7234 רָבַד\nStrong's: a coverlet\nKJV: covering of tapestry.\n\nCognate Group: H4765 (covering of tapestry), H7234 (deck)\nGreek Equivalents: G2750 κειρία",
    4766: "מַרְבֶה (marbeh | mar-beh')\n\nDerivation: from H7235 רָבָה\nStrong's: properly, increasing; as noun, greatness, or (adverbially) greatly\nKJV: great, increase.\n\nCognate Group: H4768 (greatest part), H4766 (great), H4767 (much), H8635 (increase), H697 (grasshopper), H7235 (abundance), H8636 (increase)\nGreek Equivalents: G3173 μέγας",
    4767: "מִרְבָּה (mirbâh | meer-baw')\n\nDerivation: from H7235 רָבָה\nStrong's: abundance, i.e. a great quantity\nKJV: much.\n\nCognate Group: H4768 (greatest part), H4766 (great), H4767 (much), H8635 (increase), H697 (grasshopper), H7235 (abundance), H8636 (increase)\nGreek Equivalents: G4121 πλεονάζω",
    4768: "מַרְבִּית (marbîyth | mar-beeth')\n\nDerivation: from H7235 רָבָה\nStrong's: a multitude; also offspring; specifically interest (on capital)\nKJV: greatest part, greatness, increase, multitude.\n\nCognate Group: H4768 (greatest part), H4766 (great), H4767 (much), H8635 (increase), H697 (grasshopper), H7235 (abundance), H8636 (increase)\nGreek Equivalents: G4052 περισσεύω",
