    4930: "מַשְׂמְרָה (masmᵉrâh | mas-mer-aw')\n\nDerivation: for H4548 מַסְמֵר fem.\nStrong's: a peg\nKJV: nail.\n\nCognate Group: H5575 (blindness), H5581 (Sisamai), H5572 (bush), H5576 (Sennacherib), H5568 (stand up), H5569 (rough), H5573 (Seneh), H4548 (nail), H5580 (moth), H5570 (Senaah), H5579 (fins), H5577 (bough), H5571 (Sanballat), H5574 (Hasenuah), H5578 (Sansannah), H4930 (nail)",
