    4964: "מֶתֶג (metheg | meh-theg)\n\nDerivation: from an unused root meaning to curb\nStrong's: a bit\nKJV: bit, bridle.\n\nCognate Group: H4965 (Metheg-ammah), H4964 (bit)\nGreek Equivalents: G2759 κέντρον, G5469 χαλινός",
