    4987: "מֹתֶק (môtheq | mo'-thek)\n\nDerivation: from H4985 מָתַק\nStrong's: sweetness\nKJV: sweetness.\n\nCognate Group: H4990 (Mithredath), H4987 (sweetness), H4988 (feed sweetly), H4985 (be sweet), H4986 (sweetness), H4477 (sweet), H4966 (sweet), H4989 (Mithcah)",
    4988: "מָתָק (mâthâq | maw-thawk')\n\nDerivation: from H4985 מָתַק\nStrong's: a dainty, i.e. (generally) food\nKJV: feed sweetly.\n\nCognate Group: H4990 (Mithredath), H4987 (sweetness), H4988 (feed sweetly), H4985 (be sweet), H4986 (sweetness), H4477 (sweet), H4966 (sweet), H4989 (Mithcah)",
