    5176: "נָחָשׁ (Nâchâsh | naw-khawsh')\n\nDerivation: the same as H5175 נָחָשׁ\nStrong's: Nachash, the name of two persons apparently non-Israelite\nKJV: Nahash.\n\nCognate Group: H5904 (Irnahash), H5177 (Naashon), H5176 (Nahash), H5175 (serpent)",
