    5448: "סֹבֶל (çôbel | so'-bel)\n\nDerivation: (only in the form סֻבָּל; from H5445 סָבַל\nStrong's: a load (figuratively)\nKJV: burden.\n\nCognate Group: H5451 (Sibboleth), H5445 (bear), H5454 (Sabta), H5448 (burden), H5453 (Sibraim), H5447 (burden), H5455 (Sabtecha), H5449 (burden), H5450 (burden)\nGreek Equivalents: G2218 ζυγός, G2749 κεῖμαι",
    5449: "סַבָּל (çabbâl | sab-bawl')\n\nDerivation: from H5445 סָבַל\nStrong's: a porter\nKJV: (to bear, bearer of) burden(-s).\n\nCognate Group: H5451 (Sibboleth), H5445 (bear), H5454 (Sabta), H5448 (burden), H5453 (Sibraim), H5447 (burden), H5455 (Sabtecha), H5449 (burden), H5450 (burden)",
