    5454: "סַבְתָּא (Çabtâʼ | sab-taw')\n\nDerivation: or סַבְתָּה; probably of foreign derivation\nStrong's: Sabta or Sabtah, the name of a son of Cush, and the country occupied by his posterity\nKJV: Sabta, Sabtah.\n\nCognate Group: H5451 (Sibboleth), H5445 (bear), H5454 (Sabta), H5448 (burden), H5453 (Sibraim), H5447 (burden), H5455 (Sabtecha), H5449 (burden), H5450 (burden)",
