    5475: "סֹוד (çôwd | sode)\n\nDerivation: from H3245 יָסַד\nStrong's: a session, i.e. company of persons (in close deliberation); by implication, intimacy, consultation, a secret\nKJV: assembly, consel, inward, secret (counsel).\n\nCognate Group: H5475 (assembly), H5476 (Sodi)\nGreek Equivalents: G1012 βουλή, G1106 γνώμη, G1984 ἐπισκοπή, G4864 συναγωγή, G4892 συνέδριον, G4963 συστροφή, G5287 ὑπόστασις",
