    5477: "סוּחַ (Çûwach | soo'-akh)\n\nDerivation: from an unused root meaning to wipe away; sweeping\nStrong's: Suach, an Israelite\nKJV: Suah.\n\nCognate Group: H5477 (Suah), H5479 (Sotai), H5478 (torn)",
