    5921: "עַל (ʻal | al)\n\nDerivation: properly, the same as H5920 עַל used as a preposition (in the singular or plural often with prefix, or as conjunction with a particle following)\nStrong's: above, over, upon, or against (yet always in this last relation with a downward aspect) in a great variety of applications\nKJV: above, according to(-ly), after, (as) against, among, and, [idiom] as, at, because of, beside (the rest of), between, beyond the time, [idiom] both and, by (reason of), [idiom] had the charge of, concerning for, in (that), (forth, out) of, (from) (off), (up-) on, over, than, through(-out), to, touching, [idiom] with.\n\nCognate Group: H5921 (above), H518 (but), H3589 (destruction), H3651 (after that), H3588 (and)\nGreek Equivalents: G1122 γραμματεύς, G1847 ἐξουδενόω, G1883 ἐπάνω, G1883 ἐπάνω, G1883 ἐπάνω, G2192 ἔχω, G2212 ζητέω, G2945 κύκλῳ, G3365 μηδαμῶς, G3623 οἰκονόμος, G3864 παραθαλάσσιος, G4057 περισσῶς, G4133 πλήν, G4383 πρόσωπον, G5231 ὑπεράνω",
