    5925: "עֻלָּא (ʻUllâʼ | ool-law')\n\nDerivation: feminine of H5923 עֹל ; burden\nStrong's: Ulla, an Israelite\nKJV: Ulla.\n\nCognate Group: H5916 (trouble), H5911 (Achor), H5925 (Ulla), H5919 (adder), H5918 (Ocran)",
