    6217: "עָשׁוּק (ʻâshûwq | aw-shook')\n\nDerivation: or עָשֻׁק; passive participle of H6231 עָשַׁק\nStrong's: used in plural masculine as abstractly, tyranny\nKJV: oppressed(-ion). (Doubtful.)\n\nCognate Group: H6217 (oppressed), H6216 (oppressor), H6231 (get deceitfully), H6233 (cruelly), H6234 (oppressed), H6232 (Eshek), H4642 (oppression)",
