    6222: "עֲשָׂיָה (ʻĂsâyâh | aw-saw-yaw')\n\nDerivation: from H6213 עָשָׂה and H3050 יָהּ ; Jah has made\nStrong's: Asajah, the name of three or four Israelites\nKJV: Asaiah.\n\nCognate Group: H6222 (Asaiah), H3299 (Jaasau), H4640 (Maasiai), H4639 (act), H3300 (Jaasiel), H6214 (Asahel), H6221 (Asiel), H6213 (accomplish), H4641 (Maaseiah)",
    6223: "עָשִׁיר (ʻâshîyr | aw-sheer')\n\nDerivation: from H6238 עָשַׁר\nStrong's: rich, whether literal or figurative (noble)\nKJV: rich (man).\n\nCognate Group: H6223 (rich), H6239 ([idiom] far), H6238 (be rich)\nGreek Equivalents: G4145 πλούσιος",
