    6229: "עָשַׂק (ʻâsaq | aw-sak)\n\nDerivation: a primitive root (identical with H6231 עָשַׁק)\nStrong's: to press upon, i.e. quarrel\nKJV: strive with.\n\nCognate Group: H6230 (Esek), H6229 (strive with)\nGreek Equivalents: G91 ἀδικέω",
