    6282: "עָתָר (ʻâthâr | aw-thawr')\n\nDerivation: from H6280 עָתַר ; also compare H6279 עָתַר \nStrong's: incense (as increasing to a volume of smoke); hence a worshipper\nKJV: suppliant, thick.\n\nCognate Group: H6282 (suppliant), H6279 (intreat)",
    6283: "עֲתֶרֶת (ʻăthereth | ath-eh'-reth)\n\nDerivation: from H6280 עָתַר\nStrong's: copiousness\nKJV: abundance. p\n\nCognate Group: H6283 (abundance), H6280 (deceitful), H6281 (Ether)",
