    6289: "פָּארוּר (pâʼrûwr | paw-roor')\n\nDerivation: from H6286 פָּאַר\nStrong's: properly, illuminated, i.e. a glow; as noun, a flush (of anxiety)\nKJV: blackness.\n\nCognate Group: H6286 (beautify), H6290 (Paran), H6288 (bough), H6289 (blackness)",
