    6992: "קְטַל (qᵉṭal | ket-al')\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) corresponding to H6991 קָטַל\nStrong's: to kill\nKJV: slay.\n\nCognate Group: H6992 (slay)\nGreek Equivalents: G337 ἀναιρέω, G1806 ἐξάγω, G4881 συναπόλλυμι",
