    7149: "קִרְיָא (qiryâʼ | keer-yaw')\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) or קִרְיָה; (Aramaic), corresponding to H7151 קִרְיָה \nStrong's: building; a city\nKJV: city.\n\nCognate Group: H7187 (truth), H7170 (accuse), H7162 (horn), H7127 (approach), H7129 (war), H7149 (city)\nGreek Equivalents: G2968 κώμη, G3390 μητρόπολις, G4172 πόλις",
