    7243: "רְבִיעִי (rᵉbîyʻîy | reb-ee-ee')\n\nDerivation: or רְבִעִי; from H7251 רָבַע\nStrong's: fourth; also (fractionally) a fourth\nKJV: foursquare, fourth (part).\n\nCognate Group: H7255 (fourth participle), H7256 (fourth), H7251 (square), H705 (-forty), H702 (four), H7253 (fourth part), H7243 (foursquare), H706 (fourfold)\nGreek Equivalents: G5066 τεταρταῖος, G5067 τέταρτος",
