    7399: "רְכוּשׁ (rᵉkûwsh | rek-oosh')\n\nDerivation: or רְכֻשׁ; from passive participle of H7408 רָכַשׁ\nStrong's: property (as gathered)\nKJV: good, riches, substance.\n\nCognate Group: H7408 (gather), H7409 (dromedary), H7399 (good)\nGreek Equivalents: G2934 κτῆνος, G5223 ὕπαρξις, G5225 ὑπάρχω, G5536 χρῆμα",
