    7506: "רֶפַח (Rephach | reh'-fakh)\n\nDerivation: from an unused root apparently meaning to sustain; support\nStrong's: Rephach, an Israelite\nKJV: Rephah.\n\nCognate Group: H7497 (giant), H7506 (Rephah), H7496 (dead), H7503 (abate), H7510 (feebleness), H7504 (weak)",
