    7513: "רַפְסֹדָה (raphçôdâh | raf-so-daw')\n\nDerivation: from H7511 רָפַס\nStrong's: a raft (as flat on the water)\nKJV: flote.\n\nCognate Group: H7513 (flote), H4833 (that which), H7515 (foul), H7511 (humble self)",
