    7521: "רָצָה (râtsâh | raw-tsaw')\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to be pleased with; specifically, to satisfy a debt\nKJV: (be) accept(-able), accomplish, set affection, approve, consent with, delight (self), enjoy, (be, have a) favour(-able), like, observe, pardon, (be, have, take) please(-ure), reconcile self.\n\nCognate Group: H8656 (Tirzah), H7522 (acceptable), H7521 (accept)\nGreek Equivalents: G25 ἀγαπάω, G1184 δεκτός, G1209 δέχομαι, G1259 διαλλάσσω, G1522 εἰσακούω, G1984 ἐπισκοπή, G2106 εὐδοκέω, G2127 εὐλογέω, G2137 εὐοδόω, G2309 θέλω, G3089 λύω, G3858 παραδέχομαι, G4327 προσδέχομαι, G4936 συντρέχω",
    7522: "רָצֹון (râtsôwn | raw-tsone')\n\nDerivation: or רָצֹן; from H7521 רָצָה\nStrong's: delight (especially as shown)\nKJV: (be) acceptable(-ance, -ed), delight, desire, favour, (good) pleasure, (own, self, voluntary) will, as...(what) would.\n\nCognate Group: H8656 (Tirzah), H7522 (acceptable), H7521 (accept)\nGreek Equivalents: G701 ἀρεστός, G1013 βούλημα, G1184 δεκτός, G1656 ἔλεος, G1939 ἐπιθυμία, G2107 εὐδοκία, G2307 θέλημα, G2308 θέλησις, G2431 ἱλαρός, G2432 ἱλαρότης, G5485 χάρις",
    7523: "רָצַח (râtsach | raw-tsakh')\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: properly, to dash in pieces, i.e. kill (a human being), especially to murder\nKJV: put to death, kill, (man-) slay(-er), murder(-er).\n\nCognate Group: H7524 (slaughter), H7523 (put to death), H7525 (Rezia), H7526 (Rezin)\nGreek Equivalents: G5407 φονεύω, G5408 φόνος",
    7524: "רֶצַח (retsach | reh-tsakh)\n\nDerivation: from H7523 רָצַח\nStrong's: a crushing; specifically, a murder-cry\nKJV: slaughter, sword.\n\nCognate Group: H7524 (slaughter), H7523 (put to death), H7525 (Rezia), H7526 (Rezin)\nGreek Equivalents: G995 βοή",
    7525: "רִצְיָא (Ritsyâʼ | rits-yaw')\n\nDerivation: from H7521 רָצָה ; delight\nStrong's: Ritsjah, an Israelite\nKJV: Rezia.\n\nCognate Group: H7524 (slaughter), H7523 (put to death), H7525 (Rezia), H7526 (Rezin)\nGreek Equivalents: G4406 πρώϊμος",
    7526: "רְצִין (Rᵉtsîyn | rets-een')\n\nDerivation: probably for H7522 רָצֹון\nStrong's: Retsin, the name of a Syrian and of an Israelite\nKJV: Rezin.\n\nCognate Group: H7524 (slaughter), H7523 (put to death), H7525 (Rezia), H7526 (Rezin)",
