    7530: "רֶצֶף (Retseph | reh'-tsef)\n\nDerivation: the same as H7529 רֶצֶף\nStrong's: Retseph, a place in Assyrian\nKJV: Rezeph.\n\nCognate Group: H7529 (coal), H7532 (Rizpah), H7530 (Rezeph), H7531 (live coal)",
