    7729: "שׁוּבָה (shûwbâh | shoo-baw')\n\nDerivation: from H7725 שׁוּב\nStrong's: a return\nKJV: returning.\n\nCognate Group: H3434 (Jashobeam), H8666 (answer), H7725 (to turn back), H3437 (Jashub), H7727 (Shobab), H3142 (Jushab-hesed), H7780 (Shophach), H7728 (backsliding), H7870 (captivity), H3433 (Jashubi-lehem), H4878 (backsliding), H7729 (returning), H7726 (backsliding), H7731 (Shobach), H4877 (Meshobab), H3432 (Jashubites)",
