    7733: "שֹׁובֵק (Shôwbêq | sho-bake')\n\nDerivation: active participle from a primitive root meaning to leave (compare H7662 שְׁבַק); forsaking\nStrong's: Shobek, an Israelite\nKJV: Shobek.\n\nCognate Group: H7733 (Shobek), H3435 (Ishbak)",
    7734: "שׂוּג (sûwg | soog)\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to retreat\nKJV: turn back.\n\nCognate Group: H7873 (pursuing), H5472 (backslider), H5253 (departing away), H7734 (turn back), H5509 (dross)",
