    7774: "שׁוּעָא (Shûwʻâʼ | shoo-aw')\n\nDerivation: from H7768 שָׁוַע ; wealth\nStrong's: Shua, an Israelitess\nKJV: Shua.\n\nCognate Group: H8668 (deliverance), H3471 (jasper), H3470 (Isaiah), H1954 (Hosea), H7774 (Shua), H3444 (deliverance), H7769 (cry), H7770 (Shua), H4190 (salvation), H3469 (Ishi), H7771 (bountiful), H4338 (Mesha), H3468 (safety), H4337 (Mesha), H3467 ([idiom] at all), H1955 (Hoshaiah)",
