    7776: "שׁוּעָל (shûwʻâl | shoo-awl')\n\nDerivation: or שֻׁעָל; from the same as H8168 שֹׁעַל\nStrong's: a jackal (as a burrower)\nKJV: fox.\n\nCognate Group: H7776 (fox), H8169 (Shaalabbin), H8170 (Shaalbonite), H7777 (Shual), H8171 (Shalim)\nGreek Equivalents: G258 ἀλώπηξ",
