    7781: "שׁוּפָמִי (Shûwphâmîy | shoo-faw-mee')\n\nDerivation: patronymic from H8197 שְׁפוּפָם\nStrong's: a Shuphamite (collectively) or descendants of Shephupham\nKJV: Shuphamite.\n\nCognate Group: H7781 (Shuphamite), H8207 (adder), H8206 (Shuppim), H8197 (Shephuphan)",
