    7783: "שׁוּק (shûwq | shook)\n\nDerivation: a primitive root\nStrong's: to run after or over, i.e. overflow\nKJV: overflow, water.\n\nCognate Group: H7783 (overflow)\nGreek Equivalents: G3182 μεθύσκω",
