    8328: "שֶׁרֶשׁ (sheresh | sheh'-resh)\n\nDerivation: from H8327 שָׁרַשׁ\nStrong's: a root (literally or figuratively)\nKJV: bottom, deep, heel, root.\n\nCognate Group: H8329 (Sharesh), H8328 (bottom), H8331 (chain), H8327 (root)\nGreek Equivalents: G1610 ἐκριζόω",
    8329: "שֶׁרֶשׁ (Sheresh | sheh'-resh)\n\nDerivation: the same as H8328 שֶׁרֶשׁ\nStrong's: Sheresh, an Israelite\nKJV: Sharesh.\n\nCognate Group: H8329 (Sharesh), H8328 (bottom), H8331 (chain), H8327 (root)",
    8330: "שֹׁרֶשׁ (shôresh | sho'-resh)\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) corresponding to H8328 שֶׁרֶשׁ \nStrong's: a root (literally or figuratively)\nKJV: root.\n\nCognate Group: H8332 (banishment), H8330 (root), H8340 (Sheshbazzar)\nGreek Equivalents: G4491 ῥίζα",
    8331: "שַׁרְשָׁה (sharshâh | shar-shaw')\n\nDerivation: from H8327 שָׁרַשׁ\nStrong's: a chain (as rooted, i.e. linked)\nKJV: chain. Compare H8333 שַׁרְשְׁרָה .\n\nCognate Group: H8329 (Sharesh), H8328 (bottom), H8331 (chain), H8327 (root)",
