    8347: "שֵׁשַׁךְ (Shêshak | shay-shak')\n\nDerivation: of foreign derivation\nStrong's: Sheshak, a symbolic name of Babylon\nKJV: Sheshach.\n\nCognate Group: H8350 (vermillion), H8348 (Sheshan), H8343 (Shashai), H8339 (Sheshbazzar), H8344 (Sheshai), H8347 (Sheshach), H8349 (Shashak), H8338 (leave by the sixth part)",
