    8619: "תָּקֹועַ (tâqôwaʻ | taw-ko'-ah)\n\nDerivation: from H8628 תָּקַע (in the musical sense)\nStrong's: a trumpet\nKJV: trumpet.\n\nCognate Group: H8628 (blow), H8621 (Tekoite), H8619 (trumpet), H8620 (Tekoa), H8629 (sound)\nGreek Equivalents: G4536 σάλπιγξ",
    8620: "תְּקֹועַ (Tᵉqôwaʻ | tek-o'-ah)\n\nDerivation: a form of H8619 תָּקֹועַ\nStrong's: Tekoa, a place in Palestine\nKJV: Tekoa, Tekoah.\n\nCognate Group: H8628 (blow), H8621 (Tekoite), H8619 (trumpet), H8620 (Tekoa), H8629 (sound)",
