    8631: "תְּקֵף (tᵉqêph | tek-afe')\n\nDerivation: (Aramaic) corresponding to H8630 תָּקַף\nStrong's: to become (causatively, make) mighty or (figuratively) obstinate\nKJV: make firm, harden, be(-come) strong.\n\nCognate Group: H8631 (make firm), H8624 (mighty), H8632 (might)\nGreek Equivalents: G1765 ἐνισχύω, G2480 ἰσχύω, G2901 κραταιόω",
