    441: "ἀνθρωπάρεσκος (anthrōpáreskos | anth-ro-par'-es-kos)\n\nDerivation: from G444 and G700\nStrong's: man-courting, i.e. fawning\nKJV: —men-pleaser.\n\nSee: G444 \nSee: G700 \n\nCognate Group: G2100 (please), G701 (please), G699 (pleasing), G700 (please), G2101 (acceptable), G441 (men-pleaser)\nVariants: ἀνθρωπάρεσκος",
