    445: "ἀνθυπατεύω (anthypateúō | anth-oo-pat-yoo'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G446\nStrong's: to act as proconsul\nKJV: —be the deputy.\n\nSee: G446 \n\nCognate Group: G444 (certain), G442 (human)\nVariants: ἀνθυπατεύω G477",
