    448: "ἀνίλεως (aníleōs | an-ee'-leh-oce)\n\nDerivation: from G1 (as a negative particle) and G2436\nStrong's: inexorable\nKJV: —without mercy.\n\nSee: G1 \nSee: G2436 \n\nCognate Group: G448 (without mercy), G1656 (mercy), G415 (unmerciful), G1655 (merciful), G1653 (have compassion), G1654 (alms)\nVariants: ἀνίλεως, ἀνέλεος",
    449: "ἄνιπτος (ániptos | an'-ip-tos)\n\nDerivation: from G1 (as a negative particle) and a presumed derivative of G3538\nStrong's: without ablution\nKJV: —unwashen.\n\nSee: G1 \nSee: G3538 \n\nCognate Group: G3537 (bason), G449 (unwashen), G3538 (wash)\nVariants: ἄνιπτος",
    450: "ἀνίστημι (anístēmi | an-is'-tay-mee)\n\nDerivation: from G303 and G2476\nStrong's: to stand up (literal or figurative, transitive or intransitive)\nKJV: —arise, lift up, raise up (again), rise (again), stand up(-right).\n\nSee: G303 \nSee: G2476 \n\nCognate Group: G1815 (resurrection), G450 (arise), G386 (raised to life again), G1817 (raise up)\nVariants: ἀνίστημι, ἀναπηδάω \nHebrew Equivalents: H247 אָזַר, H553 אָמַץ, H935 בֹּוא, H1961 הָיָה, H2388 חָזַק, H2421 חָיָה, H3320 יָצַב, H5375 נָשָׂא, H5414 נָתַן, H5927 עָלָה, H5975 עָמַד, H6965 קוּם, H6965 קוּם, H6974 קוּץ, H7925 שָׁכַם",
    451: "Ἄννα (Ánna | an'-nah)\n\nDerivation: of Hebrew origin (H2584)\nStrong's: Anna, an Israelitess\nKJV: —Anna.\nSee: H2584\n\nCognate Group: G1815 (resurrection), G450 (arise), G386 (raised to life again), G1817 (raise up)\nVariants: Ἄννα, Ἅννα, Ἇννα \nHebrew Equivalents: H2583 חָנָה, H2584 חַנָּה",
