    483: "ἀντιλέγω (antilégō | an-til'-eg-o)\n\nDerivation: from G473 and G3004\nStrong's: to dispute, refuse\nKJV: —answer again, contradict, deny, gainsay(-er), speak against.\n\nSee: G473 \nSee: G3004 \n\nCognate Group: G4878 (help), G484 (help), G482 (help)\nVariants: ἀντιλέγω \nHebrew Equivalents: H5472 סוּג, H7378 רִיב",
