    485: "ἀντιλογία (antilogía | an-tee-log-ee'-ah)\n\nDerivation: from a derivative of G483\nStrong's: dispute, disobedience\nKJV: —contradiction, gainsaying, strife.\n\nSee: G483 \n\nCognate Group: G4878 (help), G484 (help), G482 (help)\nVariants: ἀντιλογία \nHebrew Equivalents: H1697 דָּבָר, H4066 מָדֹון, H4806 מְרִיא, H7379 רִיב",
