    1331: "διερωτάω (dierōtáō | dee-er-o-tah'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G1223 and G2065\nStrong's: to question throughout, i.e. ascertain by interrogation\nKJV: —make enquiry for.\n\nSee: G1223 \nSee: G2065 \n\nCognate Group: G1330 (come), G565 (come), G1525 (X arise), G4905 (accompany), G4281 (go before), G4022 (fetch a compass), G2064 (accompany), G1904 (come), G4334 (come), G1831 (come), G3928 (come), G3922 (come in privily)\nVariants: διερωτάω",
