    1335: "διήγεσις (diḗgesis | dee-ayg'-es-is)\n\nDerivation: from G1334\nStrong's: a recital\nKJV: —declaration.\n\nSee: G1334 \n\nCognate Group: G4285 (prefer), G2233 (account), G1834 (declare), G1335 (declaration)\nVariants: διήγεσις, διήγησις \nHebrew Equivalents: H2420 חִידָה, H4557 מִסְפָּר",
    1336: "διηνεκής (diēnekḗs | dee-ay-nek-es')\n\nDerivation: neuter of a compound of G1223 and a derivative of an alternate of G5342\nStrong's: carried through, i.e. (adverbially with G1519 and G3588 prefixed) perpetually\nKJV: —+ continually, for ever.\n\nSee: G1223 \nSee: G5342 \nSee: G1519 \nSee: G3588 \n\nCognate Group: G4285 (prefer), G2233 (account), G1834 (declare), G1335 (declaration)\nVariants: διηνεκής",
