    1340: "διϊσχυρίζομαι (diïschyrízomai | dee-is-khoo-rid'-zom-ahee)\n\nDerivation: from G1223 and a derivative of G2478\nStrong's: to stout it through, i.e. asservate\nKJV: —confidently (constantly) affirm.\n\nSee: G1223 \nSee: G2478 \n\nCognate Group: G4285 (prefer), G2233 (account), G1834 (declare), G1335 (declaration)\nVariants: διϊσχυρίζομαι",
