    1386: "δόλιος (dólios | dol'-ee-os)\n\nDerivation: from G1388\nStrong's: guileful\nKJV: —deceitful.\n\nSee: G1388 \n\nCognate Group: G1381 (allow), G1383 (trial), G1382 (experience), G1384 (approved), G96 (castaway)\nVariants: δόλιος \nHebrew Equivalents: H1814 דָּלַק, H2513 חֶלְקָה, H4820 מִרְמָה, H5766 עֶוֶל, H7423 רְמִיָּה, H8267 שֶׁקֶר, H8649 תׇּרְמָה",
