    1432: "δωρεάν (dōreán | do-reh-an')\n\nDerivation: accusative case of G1431 as adverb\nStrong's: gratuitously (literally or figuratively)\nKJV: —without a cause, freely, for naught, in vain.\n\nSee: G1431 \n\nCognate Group: G1432 (without a cause), G3860 (betray), G467 (recompense), G3862 (ordinance), G1325 (adventure), G468 (recompense), G1431 (gift), G591 (deliver), G1434 (gift), G469 (reward), G1433 (give), G1435 (gift)\nVariants: δωρεάν",
