    1526: "εἰσί (eisí | i-see')\n\nDerivation: 3rd person plural present indicative of G1510\nStrong's: they are\nKJV: —agree, are, be, dure, X is, were.\n\nSee: G1510 \n\nCognate Group: G1525 (X arise)\nVariants: εἰσί, εἰμί",
    1527: "εἷς καθ’ εἷς (heîs kath’ heîs | hice kath hice)\n\nDerivation: from G1520 repeated with G2596 inserted\nStrong's: severally\nKJV: —one by one.\n\nSee: G1520 \nSee: G2596 \n\nCognate Group: G1525 (X arise)\nVariants: εἷς καθ’ εἷς, εἷς, κατά",
