    1529: "εἴσοδος (eísodos | ice'-od-os)\n\nDerivation: from G1519 and G3598\nStrong's: an entrance (literally or figuratively)\nKJV: —coming, enter(-ing) in (to).\n\nSee: G1519 \nSee: G3598 \n\nCognate Group: G3595 (guide), G3594 (guide), G3598 (journey), G1327 (highway), G1841 (decease), G1529 (coming), G3180 (wile)\nVariants: εἴσοδος \nHebrew Equivalents: H935 בֹּוא, H1560 גְּלָל, H2122 זִיו, H3318 יָצָא, H5592 סַף, H6607 פֶּתַח",
    1530: "εἰσπηδάω (eispēdáō | ice-pay-dah'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G1519 and πηδάω (to leap)\nStrong's: to rush in\nKJV: —run (spring) in.\n\nSee: G1519 \n\nCognate Group: G3595 (guide), G3594 (guide), G3598 (journey), G1327 (highway), G1841 (decease), G1529 (coming), G3180 (wile)\nVariants: εἰσπηδάω, ἐκπηδάω \nHebrew Equivalents: H935 בֹּוא, H2187 זָנַק, H3318 יָצָא, H6485 פָּקַד",
    1531: "εἰσπορεύομαι (eisporeúomai | ice-por-yoo'-om-ahee)\n\nDerivation: from G1519 and G4198\nStrong's: to enter (literally or figuratively)\nKJV: —come (enter) in, go into.\n\nSee: G1519 \nSee: G4198 \n\nCognate Group: G4198 (depart), G1607 (come), G1531 (come in)\nVariants: εἰσπορεύομαι, εἰσπορεύω \nHebrew Equivalents: H935 בֹּוא, H1980 הָלַךְ, H3318 יָצָא, H3381 יָרַד, H5674 עָבַר, H5927 עָלָה, H5953 עָלַל",
    1532: "εἰστρέχω (eistréchō | ice-trekh'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G1519 and G5143\nStrong's: to hasten inward\nKJV: —run in.\n\nSee: G1519 \nSee: G5143 \n\nCognate Group: G4198 (depart), G1607 (come), G1531 (come in)\nVariants: εἰστρέχω",
