    1786: "ἐντόπιος (entópios | en-top'-ee-os)\n\nDerivation: from G1722 and G5117\nStrong's: a resident\nKJV: —of that place.\n\nSee: G1722 \nSee: G5117 \n\nCognate Group: G1785 (commandment), G1781 (charge)\nVariants: ἐντόπιος",
