    1790: "ἔντρομος (éntromos | en'-trom-os)\n\nDerivation: from G1722 and G5156\nStrong's: terrified\nKJV: —X quake, X trembled.\n\nSee: G1722 \nSee: G5156 \n\nCognate Group: G1785 (commandment), G1781 (charge)\nVariants: ἔντρομος, ἔκτρομος \nHebrew Equivalents: H7460 רָעַד, H7494 רַעַשׁ",
    1791: "ἐντροπή (entropḗ | en-trop-ay')\n\nDerivation: from G1788\nStrong's: confusion\nKJV: —shame.\n\nSee: G1788 \n\nCognate Group: G1785 (commandment), G1781 (charge)\nVariants: ἐντροπή \nHebrew Equivalents: H3639 כְּלִמָּה",
