    1815: "ἐξανάστασις (exanástasis | ex-an-as'-tas-is)\n\nDerivation: from G1817\nStrong's: a rising from death\nKJV: —resurrection.\n\nSee: G1817 \n\nCognate Group: G1815 (resurrection), G450 (arise), G386 (raised to life again), G1817 (raise up)\nVariants: ἐξανάστασις",
