    1838: "ἕξις (héxis | hex'-is)\n\nDerivation: from G2192\nStrong's: habit, i.e. (by implication) practice\nKJV: —use.\n\nSee: G2192 \n\nCognate Group: G4285 (prefer), G2233 (account), G1834 (declare), G1335 (declaration)\nVariants: ἕξις",
