    2643: "καταλλαγή (katallagḗ | kat-al-lag-ay')\n\nDerivation: from G2644\nStrong's: exchange (figuratively, adjustment), i.e. restoration to (the divine) favor\nKJV: —atonement, reconciliation(-ing).\n\nSee: G2644 \n\nCognate Group: G604 (reconcile), G1259 (reconcile), G2644 (reconcile), G3337 (change), G2643 (atonement), G525 (deliver), G465 (in exchange), G236 (change)\nVariants: καταλλαγή",
