    2652: "κατανάθεμα (katanáthema | kat-an-ath'-em-ah)\n\nDerivation: from G2596 (intensive) and G331\nStrong's: an imprecation\nKJV: —curse.\n\nSee: G2596 \nSee: G331 \n\nCognate Group: G334 (gift), G2652 (curse), G4323 (in conference add), G2653 (curse), G332 (curse), G394 (communicate), G331 (accused)\nVariants: κατανάθεμα, κατάθεμα",
