    2665: "καταπέτασμα (katapétasma | kat-ap-et'-as-mah)\n\nDerivation: from a compound of G2596 and a congener of G4072\nStrong's: something spread thoroughly, i.e. (specially) the door screen (to the Most Holy Place) in the Jewish Temple\nKJV: —vail.\n\nSee: G2596 \nSee: G4072 \n\nCognate Group: G2665 (vail)\nVariants: καταπέτασμα \nHebrew Equivalents: H4539 מָסָךְ, H6532 פֹּרֶכֶת",
