    2668: "καταπλέω (katapléō | kat-ap-leh'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G2596 and G4126\nStrong's: to sail down upon a place, i.e. to land at\nKJV: —arrive.\n\nSee: G2596 \nSee: G4126 \n\nCognate Group: G3895 (fall away), G4098 (fail), G4045 (fall among), G1601 (be cast), G3900 (fall), G2667 (fall), G4431 (fall), G4430 (dead body)\nVariants: καταπλέω",
