    2694: "κατασύρω (katasýrō | kat-as-oo'-ro)\n\nDerivation: from G2596 and G4951\nStrong's: to drag down, i.e. arrest judicially\nKJV: —hale.\n\nSee: G2596 \nSee: G4951 \n\nCognate Group: G1994 (come again), G390 (abide), G1995 (conversion), G2692 (overthrow), G1294 (perverse), G2690 (overthrow), G4762 (convert), G3344 (pervert), G654 (bring again), G391 (conversation)\nVariants: κατασύρω \nHebrew Equivalents: H2834 חָשַׂף, H7857 שָׁטַף",
