    2696: "κατασφραγίζω (katasphragízō | kat-as-frag-id'-zo)\n\nDerivation: from G2596 and G4972\nStrong's: to seal closely\nKJV: —seal.\n\nSee: G2596 \nSee: G4972 \n\nCognate Group: G2696 (seal), G4973 (seal), G4972 (seal up)\nVariants: κατασφραγίζω \nHebrew Equivalents: H2856 חָתַם",
