    2701: "κατατρέχω (katatréchō | kat-at-rekh'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G2596 and G5143\nStrong's: to run down, i.e. hasten from a tower\nKJV: —run down.\n\nSee: G2596 \nSee: G5143 \n\nCognate Group: G2699 (concision), G663 (severity), G3718 (rightly divide), G664 (sharply)\nVariants: κατατρέχω \nHebrew Equivalents: H4390 מָלֵא, H7291 רָדַף, H7323 רוּץ",
