    2707: "καταφροντής (kataphrontḗs | kat-af-ron-tace')\n\nDerivation: from G2706\nStrong's: a contemner\nKJV: —despiser.\n\nSee: G2706 \n\nCognate Group: G2706 (despise), G2707 (despiser), G4065 (despise)\nVariants: καταφροντής, καταφρονητής \nHebrew Equivalents: H898 בָּגַד, H900 בֹּגְדֹות",
    2708: "καταχέω (katachéō | kat-akh-eh'-o)\n\nDerivation: from G2596 and cheo (to pour)\nStrong's: to pour down (out)\nKJV: —pour.\n\nSee: G2596 \n\nCognate Group: G2706 (despise), G2707 (despiser), G4065 (despise)\nVariants: καταχέω \nHebrew Equivalents: H3332 יָצַק, H5186 נָטָה, H5844 עָטָה",
